  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kothuri Appa Rao vs State Of Andhra Pradesh on 31 July, 2019 Honourable Sri Justice D.V.S.S. Somayajulu Criminal Petition No.3636 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioners under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against them, in C.C.No.142 of 2019 on the file of the Additional Junior Civil Judge, Chilakaluripet. The offences alleged are under Sections 188, 272, 273, 420 of IPC and Sections 58, 59, 63 of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Both the counsels agree that this matter is squarely covered by the judgment of the single Judge in the batch petitions bearing Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and others.",
